# Scientific Reference List

This file will contain scientific articles and references relevant to the development of a Lingzhi (*Ganoderma lucidum*) extract-based biomaterial patch for topical antifungal applications.

## Planned Literature Topics

- Antifungal properties of *Ganoderma lucidum*.
- Biomaterial patch formulation and characterization.
- Topical drug delivery systems.
- Dermatophytes responsible for ringworm infections.
- Safety and efficacy evaluation of topical antifungal materials.

## Reference Status

Scientific references will be added after the articles have been identified and verified.
